[00:01.192][Verse 1]
[00:01.752]All yours if you want it
{"若你想要 我的一切都属于你"}
[00:05.384]Nonstop giving you everything I've got
{"永不停歇 倾尽所有为你付出"}
[00:09.151]All night till the morning
{"彻夜狂欢直至黎明破晓"}
[00:12.730]Nonstop giving you everything I've got
{"永不停歇 倾尽所有为你付出"}
[00:16.056][Pre-Chorus]
[00:16.538]Trust that the feeling come over me
{"相信这份悸动已将我包围"}
[00:20.780]And let it take me away
{"任它带我远离尘嚣"}
[00:23.527]Heaven's so close when you're holding me
{"当你拥我入怀 天堂触手可及"}
[00:27.143][Chorus]
[00:27.735]Want it again and again, take me
{"渴望一次又一次 带我沉沦"}
[00:37.776]All night, take me
